<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia Feb forex reserves reach $19.862 billion.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Feb forex reserves reach $19.862 billion.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's foreign exchange reserves rose to $19.862 billion at the end of February from $19.830 billion at the end of January, a government official said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;Indonesia's foreign reserves have risen to $19.862 billion in February,&quot; the official told Reuters.</p>
<p>The country's foreign exchange reserves totalled $19.125 billion in December and $17.825 billion in November.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
